<title>DUBAI: Saudi Azizia-Panda H1 net dips to 29.2 mln riyals.</title>
<headline>Saudi Azizia-Panda H1 net dips to 29.2 mln riyals.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>		 (million Saudi riyals unless stated)</p>
<p> Net profit	 29.2	   vs	 32.2</p>
<p> Turnover	  411.5	   vs	307.3</p>
<p> Total assets  1.195 billion   vs	1.168 billion</p>
<p>Full name: Al Azizia-Panda United Inc.</p>
<p>Note: The company, which owns a string of supermarkets, is traded on the Saudi stock market.</p>
<p>($1=3.75 riyals)</p>
<p>-- Dubai Newsroom +9714 607 1222</p>
